Lane RETIRED 2026-08-06 (owner decision, RIINA_MASTER_PLAN.md REQ-67g).

This Isabelle/HOL tree is a machine-generated port of the Coq sources. It was
never independently re-verified (0 theories compiled) and is retired rather
than left presenting a 12,931-lemma figure at claim level "generated": Lean 4
is the designated independence witness for the core metatheory (REQ-67b), and
a second redundant port adds no claim value.

generate-metrics.sh reads this marker
and sets claimLevels.isabelle = "retired"; the claim-integrity gate ranks
"retired" below every other level so this lane can never overclaim.

ARCHIVED 2026-10-20 (owner ruling D6, executing REQ-29 path D2): the generated
corpus was removed from `main`. It is preserved in history at commit fd23fbdb8
(the last commit that contains it). Restore with
`git checkout fd23fbdb8 -- 02_FORMAL/<lane>`. Only hand-written `RIINA/Active/` material
(and build files) remain in this lane.
